From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 04:50:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm/apple: sync to Aurora integration/aurora 50d5865ea6
 (file-level)

Replace drivers/gpu/drm/apple wholesale with the tree at Aurora
integration/aurora 50d5865ea6 (ports-2 H1 decision a). A forward
cherry-pick of the 192 missing upstream commits does not work on a15y
(MEASURED in ports-2: 21 apply, 165 conflict), so this is a documented
file-level sync instead of -x picks.

Result against the previous tree: 12 files added (incl.
t8132_ext_drm.c/.h, iomfb_v26_6_desktop.*, dcp-peer-v26_6.*,
dcp-syslog*), 6 a15y-only files removed (dcp-m4-edr*,
dcp-panel-adt-test.c, dcp-panel-edid*), the rest modified. The a15y-only
commits (DCP lane P3/EDR/VRR/boost, fade, J604 panel, J313/J516C, g16,
recreate the removed files.

Needs the previous commit (rtkit syslog_is_debug + t8132.h).

Upstream drm/apple commits included (git log 44d5afc79d..50d5865ea6 --
drivers/gpu/drm/apple, newest first; 44d5afc79d = merge base with a15y;
