+/*
+ * The register map of the T6041 internal DCP, from the macOS ADT capture
+ * (/arm-io/dcp reg[0], /arm-io/disp0 reg[0..3]).  The firmware maps these
+ * windows by index, so the device tree must describe exactly these.
